SCOPE — read this first
=======================

This licence covers `fixtures/` only: the eleven reference items written from
scratch for this repository, including each item's `index.html`, `src/`,
`meta.json`, `capture.json` and `notes.md`.

It does NOT cover, and nothing here grants any right to:

  * `items/`, `archives/`, `out/` and `site/`. These are gitignored and form no
    part of any distribution of this repository. They hold third-party,
    commercially licensed source — CodeGrid templates bought under a paid
    licence. That code is not ours to relicense, and a grant covering it would
    be redistribution to non-licensees.

  * The tooling in `bin/` and the web application in `web/`. All rights
    reserved. Whether these become open source is an open question, tracked in
    `docs/LOCAL-MODE.md`; until it is settled, no licence is granted over them.

The grant below is deliberately narrow. `fixtures/` is the only code in this
repository that was authored here from scratch, which is why it is the only
code that can be shown publicly — see the "Captured with it" section of the
landing page, which this file exists to make true.


